cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this test suite, please cite it as below."
title: "IEC 61131-3 conformance traces: an open, runtime-agnostic test suite for Structured Text runtimes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Celles
    given-names: Sébastien
    email: s.celles@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-celles/iec61131-conformance"
license: CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - IEC 61131-3
  - Structured Text
  - PLC
  - conformance testing
  - differential testing
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  Plain Structured Text programs paired with plain-text expected input/output
  traces, one record per scan cycle, derived by hand from the text of IEC
  61131-3 (editions 2 and 3), with harnesses for IronPLC, matiec, OpenPLC's
  matiec fork, STruC++ and RuSTy, recorded differential results, and a Lean 4
  model of the standard function blocks from which the expected traces are
  proved to follow.
date-released: 2026-11-01
version: 0.1.0
